    "notes": "Sym Companion beta.36: accepted Plugins redesign and classic Outlook draft lifecycle, guarded individual draft sending and durable send receipts. Sending defaults Off; draft age defaults10minutes and is configurable. No bulk-send API or Companion approval screens. Windows unsigned preview; Mac ARM cross-built and signed/notarized, not native-tested. Expanded cloud Outlook tools require the separate backend release.",
